# android/ and ios/ are COMMITTED (since Feature 40): they carry hand-tuned,
# unregenerable config — bundle id com.drifthr.employee, store permissions,
# release-signing wiring, fastlane lanes. Secrets stay out via android/.gitignore
# (key.properties, *.p12) and the platform .gitignores. Desktop/web targets are
# not shipped and stay ignored.
